    "font" : "CMR9",
    "font size" : 8.966,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "FIG. 4: (Color online) Plot of the CQ trade-oﬀ curve (a) and the CE trade-oﬀ curve (b) of an Unruh channel for z = 0, 0 . 2, 0 . 4, 0 . 6, 0 . 8, and 0 . 95. The trade-oﬀ curves for z = 0 correspond to those for the noiseless qubit channel and are the rightmost trade-oﬀ curves in each plot. In both plots, proceeding left from the z = 0 curve, we obtain trade-oﬀ curves for z = 0 . 2, 0 . 4, 0 . 6, 0 . 8, and 0 . 95 and notice that they all beat a time-sharing strategy by a larger relative proportion as z increases."
